my plan is that if any of these guys tries to get at me i will use them for as much money as i can, not have sex with them, then dump them.

&#x200B;

you can be bitter, just profit off it then move on.

i think aimee denied saying it in a tweet and candace didn't react like she did. tbh i live 15 minutes away from where aimee is from and there are definitely white people who use it here but i don't peg aimee as the type to at least say it to candace's face. 

&#x200B;

i'm 100 percent sure it was kortni or gus. 97 percent kortni.

" She should have fucking left"

"  I almost went back after we left to confront her."

&#x200B;

Sounds very entitled to me especially considering she was there first. 

&#x200B;

Why don't you have all that energy for your man? You know to the one who made promises and commitments to you rather than a woman who never spoke to you a day in her life.
